e the experience of going against a slasher killer from our favorite horror movies. Through many systems, mechanics and &quot;tricks&quot;, he creates the feeling of constant dread, uncertainty and omni-presence.</p>", "short_description": "Fear The Reaper is a PVP multiplayer horror game in which players take on unique roles and live out the experience of starring in a slasher film while counting down to the terrifying Judgment Hour!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988160/header.jpg?t=1788208550", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988160/604bac29cd955a789b61fea59c306d25ddbf3555/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788208550", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988160/604bac29cd955a789b61fea59c306d25ddbf3555/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788208550", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 2500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050TI<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 10100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li